Attribution
-----------

These files are derived from the GTEx Consortium's open-access annotations:

- GTEx Analysis V8 sample attributes and subject phenotypes
  (dbGaP study phs000424.v8.p2, open-access release).
- The GTEx Portal histology image table, retrieved through the public API at
  https://gtexportal.org/api/v2/histology/image.

Citation for GTEx: The GTEx Consortium, "The GTEx Consortium atlas of genetic
regulatory effects across human tissues", Science 369:1318-1330 (2020),
doi:10.1126/science.aaz1776.

The cell-class labels and per-cell coordinates are NOT curated ground truth.
They come from the HistoPlus model applied to GTEx whole-slide images upstream
of this repository, and carry a per-cell confidence value (`prob`).

Please also cite this repository and the dataset DOI when you use these files.
